WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.150
Pretty...

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.070
So pretty...

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.190
I want those crystals even more.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.710
If you want 'em, just take 'em.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.540
Defeating the Precures will get you the crystals.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.180
You'd kill two birds with one stone.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.830
That's how we should act.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:21.810
You are King Selfish's daughter, after all.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.040
That's true.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.970
But just stealing it wouldn't be any fun.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.790
I'm up against Mana, after all.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.210
I need to make it fun.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:39.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.600
Every day it sparkles

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.310
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:57.180
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:02.850
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:08.470
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:13.940
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:19.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:28.510
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:32.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.420
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:38.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:48.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:54.030
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:06.050
Betting The Crystals!

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:06.050
Betting The Crystals!

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.880
There are five crystals in total that will lead us to Ann.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.280
And we have four of them.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.230
Regina has the final one.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.760
We have to get that crystal from Regina somehow.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:22.730
What's the matter?

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:26.420
I want to avoid fighting Regina if we can...

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:30.730
Perhaps we could ask her nicely to return the crystal!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:34.740
We wouldn't be here if asking nicely worked on them.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:39.910
Is there any way we can get the crystal without fighting?

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.530
I know one.

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.680
Hi, Mana.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.380
Regina!

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.600
Heyo, Ai!

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:58.100
The other crystals are pretty, too.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.560
I want these too...

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.730
Anyway, Mana, let's play a game.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.270
A game?

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:14.490
Yes, a game with all five crystals on the line.

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.870
And the winner gets every single one.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.210
So?

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:22.180
What game will we play?

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.730
You'll just have to wait 'til it starts!

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:27.860
Fine, we'll play!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.120
Mana!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.190
This game thing is too fishy!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.450
It's just a trap to steal the crystals!

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:37.440
Should we lose, we would forfeit all of our crystals!

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.840
The risk is too great!

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:43.310
But if we win, we'll get all the crystals without a fight!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:45.580
That's my Mana.

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.780
Good girl!

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:50.540
Maybe it's no normal game, and maybe it's a trap.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:53.650
But I want to accept this challenge!

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.190
Are you with me?

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.480
I have a lot of doubts,

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.720
but when you put it like that, I can't say no.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.410
We shall be your teammates.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:06.400
We'll beat her and get that crystal! {"get" as a translation for "get." Pretty creative.}

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.230
Thanks, girls!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.590
But one thing worries me.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:15.430
Does Regina really plan to give up her crystal if we win?

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.820
The winner of the game gets all the crystals.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.550
Is that right, Regina?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:22.440
Yep.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.080
Then pinky swear.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.220
Pinky what?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.460
It shows that you won't break your promise.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.880
Promise?

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:40.560
Pinky swear and if you lie, stick a needle in your eye. {I'm kind of piecemealing this chant together, but eh.}

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.870
Do you swear, Regina?

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.460
I swear.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:48.390
Time for a first-class trip to the game world!

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:53.210
Selfish!

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:10.270
Girls!

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.600
Sorry, Trump Kingdom Knight,

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.850
but Regina did not invite you.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:27.090
Girls...

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.100
Is Ai all right?

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.960
She certainly seems so!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.590
Thank goodness...

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.600
Where are...

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.370
You're on the Game Stage that I created!

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:04.110
And you can't leave until the game is finished.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.520
Let's go, girls!

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:06.350
Yeah!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.110
Charles!

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:13.050
Precure Love Link!

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:14.770
L-O-V-E!

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:15.550
L-O-V-E!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:16.270
L-O-V-E!

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.310
L-O-V-E!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.210
Brimming with love,

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:47.300
Cure Heart!

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:51.610
The light of wisdom,

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.890
Cure Diamond!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.150
The warmth of the sun,

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:00.450
Cure Rosetta!

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.060
The blade of courage,

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.440
Cure Sword!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.160
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.820
Dokidoki Precure!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.720
Oh Regina and her Selfish trio, {alt. "Three Selfish Stooges"}

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.880
I, Cure Heart,

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.430
will make your hearts race once more!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.850
Oh, <i>please</i> make my heart race!

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.400
There are three games!

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:43.410
Our first game is a match of penalty kicks!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.410
You can do it, Sword!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.560
Get us a goal!

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.760
<i>I'll get it through!</i>

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.230
She did it!

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.780
Leave the defense to me!

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:15.220
Sure, take it.

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.590
I can catch that with ease!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.760
Ball Selfish!

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.070
Huh? What?

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:31.850
Goal!

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:32.690
Hold on!

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.740
Using a Selfish as a ball is cheating!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.830
How could you make a match so unfair?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.280
'Cause I did.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.310
After all, this is <i>my</i> world. <i>I</i> built it.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.110
And <i>I</i> make the rules.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:59.970
Look! A fish is jumping over a handstanding cat!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:00.520
Say what?!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.490
He's open!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:08.890
Hey, stop running!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.360
Stop right there, you!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.700
Selfyselfyselfyselfyselfy!

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.310
Come on...

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.740
Too bad!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.290
I'm up next!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.240
I'm ready for you!

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.310
Here it comes!

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.920
She missed!

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:35.450
Selfish.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.500
The goal is a Selfish too?

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.490
Selfiiiiiiish!

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.290
I shall not allow you!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.790
Love Heart Arrow!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.500
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:01.310
Self?!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:03.360
Yeah, she blocked it!

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.850
Selfiiiish!

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.230
Rosetta!

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.260
Goal!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.180
Are you okay?

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.600
Yes...

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.740
You're cheating too much!

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:25.210
Hey, I can cheat.

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:26.800
It's <i>my</i> game.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.670
It all comes down to this shot.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.640
You can do it, Heart!

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:35.110
Selfy selfy, hey hey hey!

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:36.310
Here I go!

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:43.420
Self?!

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.680
Sorry!

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:52.060
Wha?!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.900
She got it!

00:10:58.100 --> 00:10:59.600
Too bad!

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:03.150
We won the first game.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.240
Our second game is bowling.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:18.130
They're all strikes!

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.330
No way...

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:20.820
They're <i>actually</i> good!

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:23.240
You've finally seen our true strength.

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:26.730
We don't spend all day in a bowling alley for nothing!

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:30.170
Oh, how I've trained in secret for this day! {This is easily the best part of the episode.}

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.110
You girls are up next.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:37.540
Wh-What?!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:41.030
You have to knock every pin down to get a strike.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.460
Every pin? How many <i>are</i> there?

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.520
We'll do it!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:45.750
We have to!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:48.660
I'll go first.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:55.330
It's straight down the center!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.700
Go!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.060
Selfiiiiish.

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:01.280
Huh?

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:08.060
Ha ha, gutterball!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.660
How is it a gutterball when it rolled down the center?!

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.540
'Cause it is!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.180
That's a rule of mine.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.210
Wh-Wh-What do we do?!

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:18.000
We're doomed if we lose here!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:21.660
We're gonna lose our crystals!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:27.060
Now the crystals will be all mine...

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:45.710
Now the crystals will be all mine!

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:50.120
Hey, girls! Come here a sec... {alt. "Girls, team huddle!"}

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:55.550
So, we do this, then like that...

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.790
They tryin' to strategize?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.700
It's hard to watch them struggle in vain.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.930
Okay, got it?

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.170
Cure Rosetta shall step in!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.270
What?

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:16.070
It's the twirl she perfected in classic ballet class!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.580
Her high speed spinning can put a lot of force on the ball!

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:20.480
Now!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.780
It won't hit anything, no matter how you throw it!

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:30.900
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.720
Selfy selfy self—

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.490
Not bad...

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.710
But there's still plenty left.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:52.540
What now?

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:55.900
I'll knock every last pin down myself!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:01.860
Oh no!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.660
That throw won't hit a single pin!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:05.630
We've won!

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:07.920
Ai!

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:09.370
Kyupirappa! {Wait, so if they're relying on babyhax, what was Mana's plan in the first place?}

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.540
Huh?!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.210
We won!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.290
You did great, Ai!

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:26.570
Gweat!

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:29.220
Ai's first word!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.730
She just said "Gweat!"

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.170
She totally did!

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:35.360
Wow, that's gweat!

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:39.000
Ai's words are spreading to you too, Sword!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.380
Moving on!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.790
Our third game is dodgeball.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.710
Ai, you'll be our ref.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.250
And just like that, she sealed Ai's power.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.980
If we win this game, we win the bet!

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.550
Let's work as a team!

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:08.650
Fight on!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:28.230
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.410
Not bad.

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:41.320
What's with the court?

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:46.510
Your court's a bit slippery, so watch your step!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.570
Heart!

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:57.940
Safe!

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:59.640
Nice catch!

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.180
Geez, this is takin' forever.

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:04.430
I'll finish this up quick.

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:06.890
Mammo, you're not a window.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.220
Outta the way.

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.780
Nah. How about <i>you</i> move?

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.870
Whoops, my bad, hand slipped.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:25.960
That's fine. It happens. Hands <i>slip</i>.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.970
Oooooopsie, my hand slipped! {I love how Ira's dodge is literally just a flat rotation.}

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:36.410
Why you little...

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:39.640
Oops.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:41.210
That hurt.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:43.920
H-Hey, it wasn't on purpose, honest!

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.130
Ira! Mammo!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.640
You two jumped out of the way!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.530
<i>You</i> threw it, so <i>you</i> take the fall.

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:49.670
She speaks the truth.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.820
Why you...

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:54.790
You're all <i>so</i> dead!

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:00.960
<i>Now</i> I'm mad!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:03.850
I never liked you from the start, brat!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.230
Say what, hag?

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:08.740
I'm still a young lady!

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:10.880
You're a hag compared to my youthful energy!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.630
Um, our game?

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.450
It seems they've changed opponents.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:19.020
Well, that's Selfish Dodgeball...

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:26.490
Active

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.200
Match forfeited!

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:30.040
Which means...

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.010
The Precures won!

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:40.040
I lost?

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:42.140
Regina, remember our promise!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.510
Give us the crystal!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.350
Give them the crystal?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.940
Regina?

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:53.820
No...

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:56.040
No...

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:58.290
I want the crystals...

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.200
I don't want to give it up!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.910
The crystals are Trump Kingdom treasures.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:09.230
We need them to find someone important to us!

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.250
I need them too!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:14.990
Heart knew that your game could have been a trap!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:17.520
But she trusted you and accepted the bet!

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.670
Trusted... me?

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:24.800
That's right!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:29.040
No matter what we said, Mana kept trusting you!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.730
You wish to betray such faith?

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.000
Regina...

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:37.790
What a pain.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:40.430
Just break your promise.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.710
Can I do that?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.950
Of course you can!

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:46.400
Take what you want by force!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:50.080
Just get rid of anyone in your way.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.080
We're all Selfish.

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:56.790
Moreover, you're King Selfish's daughter.

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.440
That's right.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:01.290
I'm King Selfish's daughter!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.650
Regina!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:05.740
Promises and friendship won't make me give it up!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.860
The crystals belong to me!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.800
Selfish!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.540
Selfish, defeat the Precures and steal the crystals!

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.350
Self!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:28.970
What's yours is mine, so hand 'em over!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.830
Give me the crystals!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.290
If you don't, you'll never leave here!

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.320
We'll never let you have them!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.120
We're inside a Selfish,

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:43.030
so we should be able to leave if we purify it!

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:45.500
Steal the crystals, Selfish!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.870
Don't mind if I do!

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:53.430
Regina, promises aren't made to be broken!

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:55.440
They're made to be kept!

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:14.540
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:36.530
Love love loooove!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:21.000
Welcome back, Ai, girls.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.990
Hello again...

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:32.420
Where are the crystals?

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:33.380
Right here!

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:36.530
I've got all five of them!

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:37.570
Regina!

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:44.810
This is...

00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:46.440
Wh-What?

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.350
The crystals...

00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:59.030
Flew away...

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:04.580
{ED}

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:28.340
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:31.530
Guided By The Crystals!

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:31.530
Guided By The Crystals!

00:22:31.980 --> 00:22:33.780
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
